Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:15.88,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Meus desejos permanecem não realizados
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:20.59,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,880)\blur7.5}Presos em um sonho sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:23.88,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ocultas na minha mão direita
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.88,0:02:27.09,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Minhas memórias vazias continuam invisíveis a todos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:32.81,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Sendo açoitadas por uma chuva sem fim
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.81,0:02:38.96,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,540)\blur7.5}Seja a força para proteger o que é precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:43.46,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}Ou a fraqueza de perder a fé nisso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:46.13,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,280)\blur7.5}Aceitarei tudo isso
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.90,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur7.5}E buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:57.27,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Ao estender a mão, vejo a luz
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.27,0:03:02.52,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,780)\blur7.5}Mesmo em farrapos, você salva a minha vida
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:06.34,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\blur7.5}Todos os sentimentos depositados na ponta
